2 now uses stronger reasoning with subagents for better documentation quality.\",\n    \"updateType\": \"feature\",\n    \"url\": \"https://docs.devin.ai/release-notes/2026\",\n    \"date\": \"2026-04-25\",\n    \"community_feedback\": []\n  },\n  {\n    \"productName\": \"Devin\",\n    \"title\": \"Mid-April 2026 - Devin 2.2 with 3x Faster Startup\",\n    \"description\": \"Devin 2.2 launch brings 3x faster startup time, new UI connecting the entire dev lifecycle, and smoother Slack/Linear integrations. Also introduced full desktop testing capability where Devin can QA PRs using computer control on Linux desktop apps.\",\n    \"updateType\": \"release\",\n    \"url\": \"https://docs.devin.ai/release-notes/2026\",\n    \"date\": \"2026-04-15\",\n    \"community_feedback\": []\n  },\n  {\n    \"productName\": \"Cursor\",\n    \"title\": \"Microsoft Teams Integration and Bugbot Effort Levels\",\n    \"description\": \"Cursor is now available in Microsoft Teams - mention @Cursor to delegate tasks to cloud agents. Teams admins can customize Bugbot effort levels with Default, High, and Custom configurations. Also introduces new PR review experience, Build in Parallel feature for faster plan execution, and ability to split changes into PRs.\",\n    \"updateType\": \"feature\",\n    \"url\": \"https://cursor.com/changelog\",\n    \"date\": \"2026-04-20\",\n    \"community_feedback\": []\n  },\n  {\n    \"productName\": \"Cursor\",\n    \"title\": \"Enterprise Model Controls and Usage Analytics\",\n    \"description\": \"Enterprise admins can now set granular model access controls at provider and model level, with option to block new providers/versions by default. Soft spend limits and intelligent alerts prevent blocking users while maintaining visibility. Updated usage analytics allows filtering by users and product surfaces.\",\n    \"updateType\": \"feature\",\n    \"url\": \"https://cursor.com/changelog\",\n    \"date\": \"2026-04-10\",\n    \"community_feedback\": []\n