n        .column-header {\n            background-color: #ff6600;\n            padding: 4px 8px;\n            font-family: Arial, Helvetica, sans-serif;\n            font-size: 11pt;\n            font-weight: bold;\n            border-bottom: 1px solid #d4d4d4;\n        }\n\n        .column-content {\n            padding: 8px;\n        }\n\n        .item {\n            margin-bottom: 12px;\n            padding-bottom: 10px;\n            border-bottom: 1px solid #eeeeee;\n        }\n\n        .item:last-child {\n            border-bottom: none;\n            margin-bottom: 0;\n        }\n\n        .item-title {\n            font-size: 10pt;\n            margin-bottom: 4px;\n            line-height: 1.4;\n        }\n\n        .item-title a {\n            color: #000000;\n            font-weight: normal;\n        }\n\n        .item-title a:hover {\n            color: #000000;\n        }\n\n        .item-description {\n            font-size: 9pt;\n            color: #828282;\n            margin-bottom: 4px;\n            line-height: 1.4;\n        }\n\n        .item-meta {\n            font-size: 8pt;\n            color: #828282;\n        }\n\n        .item-meta a {\n            color: #828282;\n        }\n\n        .item-meta a:hover {\n            color: #000000;\n        }\n\n        .tag {\n            display: inline-block;\n            background-color: #f0f0f0;\n            padding: 1px 4px;\n            border-radius: 2px;\n            font-size: 8pt;\n            margin-right: 4px;\n            margin-top: 4px;\n        }\n\n        .quote {\n            background-color: #f9f9f9;\n            border-left: 3px solid #ff6600;\n            padding: 6px 8px;\n            margin: 6px 0;\n            font-size: 9pt;\n            color: #555555;\n            font-style: italic;\n            line-height: 1.4;\n        }\n\n        .update-type {\n            display: inline-block;\n            padding: 2px 6px;\n            border-radius: 2px;\n            font-size: 8pt;\n            font-weight: bold;\n            margin-bottom: 4px;\n        }\n\n        .update-type.release {\n            background-color: #e6f7ff;\n            color: #0066cc;\n        }\n\n        .update-type.feature {\n            background-color: #f6ffed;\n            color: #52c41a;\n        }\n\n        .update-type.announcement {\n            background-color: #fff7e6;\n            color: #fa8c16;\n        }\n\n        .topics {\n            margin-top: 4px;\n        }\n\n        .footer {\n            max-width: 1200px;\n            margin: 20px auto 0;\n            padding: 10px 6px;\n            border-top: 1px solid #d4d4d4;\n            text-align: center;\n            font-size: 9pt;\n            color: #828282;\n        }\n\n        .footer a {\n            color: #828282;\n            margin: 0 10px;\n        }\n\n        .footer a:hover {\n            color: #000000;\n        }\n\n        .section-count {\n            font-size: 8pt;\n            color: #828282;\n            font-weight: normal;\n            margin-left: 5px;\n        }\n\n        @media (max-width: 900px) {\n            .three-column-layout {\n                grid-template-columns: 1fr;\n            }\n        }\n\n        @media print {\n            body {\n                background-color: #ffffff;\n            }\n\n            .column {\n                border: 1px solid #000000;\n                page-break-inside: avoid;\n            }\n\n            .column-header {\n                background-color: #eeeeee !important;\n                -webkit-print-color-adjust: exact;\n                print-color-adjust: exact;\n            }\n\n            a {\n                color: #000000 !important;\n                text-decoration: underline;\n            }\n\n            .item {\n                page-break-inside: avoid;\n            }\n        }\n    </style>\n</head>\n<body>\n    <header class=\"header\">\n        <div class=\"header-content\">\n            <h1>Agentic Coding Research Report</h1>\n            <span class=\"date\">2026-05-13</span>\n            <nav>\n                <a href=\"#new-products\">New Products</a>\n                <a href=\"#whitelist-updates\">Updates</a>\n                <a href=\"#insights\">Insights</a>\n            </nav>\n        </div>\n    </header>\n\n    <div class=\"container\">\n        <main class=\"three-column-layout\">\n            <!-- New Products Section -->\n            <section class=\"column\" id=\"new-products\">\n                <div class=\"column-header\">\n                    New Products <span class=\"section-count\">(4)</span>\n                </div>\n                <div class=\"column-content\">\n                    <div class=\"item\">\n                        <div class=\"item-title\">\n                            <a href=\"https://staff.rip\" target=\"_blank\">Staff.rip</a>\n                        </div>\n                        <div class=\"item-description\">\n                            AI coding agent that lets teams describe code changes in plain language and ship them. Works across frontend, backend, microservices, and infra. Can be hosted or self-hosted with agent running locally so code never leaves machine.\n                        </div>\n                        <div class=\"item-meta\">\n                            <span class=\"tag\">code agent</span>\n                            <span class=\"tag\">Product Hunt</span>\n                            <span>2026-05-08</span>\n                        </div>\n                        <div class=\"quote\">\n                            \"Giving the capability to ship to a broader audience, the way to empower codebases with the strength of the community\"\n                        </div>\n                    </div>\n\n                    <div class=\"item\">\n                        <div class=\"item-title\">\n                            <a href=\"https://bna.ahmedbna.com\" target=\"_blank\">BNA Code</a>\n                        </div>\n                        <div class=\"item-description\">\n                            CLI AI agent that builds full-stack mobile apps from terminal. Choose stack (Expo React Native, Swift, Kotlin), describe app idea, and BNA launches frontend and backend agents to build mobile apps with authentication, realtime database, APIs, and native device features.\n                        </div>\n                        <div class=\"item-meta\">\n                            <span class=\"tag\">AI coding CLI</span>\n                            <span class=\"tag\">Product Hunt</span>\n                            <span>2026-05-06</span>\n                        </div>\n                        <div class=\"quote\">\n                            \"Just one command in your terminal. Go grab a coffee ☕ and come back to a full-stack real mobile app in favorite stack with full ownership of code and no vendor lock-in.\"\n                        </div>\n                    </div>\n\n                    <div class=\"item\">\n                        <div class=\"item-title\">\n                            <a href=\"https://clawtick.com\" target=\"_blank\">ClawTick</a>\n                        </div>\n                        <div class=\"item-description\">\n                            Cloud scheduler built specifically for AI agents. Schedule LangChain, CrewAI, or webhook tasks with one CLI command. Provides built-in monitoring, failure alerts, automatic retries, and execution logs without managing servers or cron infrastructure.\n                        </div>\n                        <div class=\"item-meta\">\n                            <span class=\"tag\">AI workflow orchestration</span>\n                            <span class=\"tag\">Product Hunt</span>\n                            <span>2026-05-06</span>\n                        </div>\n                        <div class=\"quote\">\n                            \"CLI for agents, dashboard for humans is the cleanest way to position this — the moment scheduling has to happen, you want CLI; the moment you want to know what fired and what failed, you want UI.\"\n                        </div>\n                    </div>\n\n                    <div class=\"item\">\n                        <div class=\"item-title\">\n                            <a href=\"https://www.wozcode.com\" target=\"_blank\">WOZCODE</a>\n                        </div>\n                        <div class=\"item-description\">\n                            Efficiency layer plugin for Claude Code that reduces token costs by up to 50% and improves performance. Replaces Claude's native tools with WozSearch and WozEdit for more efficient context handling. Official Anthropic-approved plugin.\n                        </div>\n                        <div class=\"item-meta\">\n                            <span class=\"tag\">AI coding CLI</span>\n                            <span class=\"tag\">Product Hunt</span>\n                            <span>2026-05-01</span>\n                        </div>\n                        <div class=\"quote\">\n                            \"In vanilla Claude Code, a simple 'find and edit 3 files' takes 12+ calls. WOZCODE collapses that to 2 calls. Context stays small, so every step that follows is cheaper and faster.\"\n                        </div>\n                    </div>\n                </div>\n            </section>\n\n            <!-- Whitelist Updates Section -->\n            <section class=\"column\" id=\"whitelist-updates\">\n                <div class=\"column-header\">\n                    Whitelist Updates <span class=\"section-count\">(11)</span>\n                </div>\n                <div class=\"column-content\">\n                    <div class=\"item\">\n                        <div class=\"item-title\">\n                            <span class=\"update-type announcement\">Claude Code</span>\n                        </div>\n                        <div class=\"item-title\"